    "dot-product-markdown-code-6": "int index = blockIdx.x * blockDim.x + threadIdx.x;\nint stride = blockDim.x * gridDim.x;\n\nfloat sum = 0.0f;\nfor (int i = index; i < N; i += stride) {\n    sum = fmaf(A[i], B[i], sum);\n}",
    "dot-product-markdown-code-7": "256 个局部和 → 128 → 64 → 32 → ... → 1 个 Block 部分和",
